    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A set of monomials, all of the same fixed size. This class assumes that a monomial is a contiguous sequence of ints, the corresponding range (for a monomial m) is [m, m + <ref refid="class_monomial_set_fixed_size_ae1f7c1882f4b465c956de8643fce1c8b_1ae1f7c1882f4b465c956de8643fce1c8b" kindref="member">elementSize()</ref>) Additionally, this class does no allocation of monomials. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
